From 14979695273b7ba20d8020db5b36d60c484419af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Russell Ballestrini <russell@unturf.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/29] b43: AC-PHY: HT40 on core rev >= 40

20/40 MHz capabilities, the 40 MHz chanspec, the TX, RX, IFS and beacon
words for 40 MHz, the bandwidth state before the radio-on and the 40 MHz
TX power rows (acphy_bw40, acphy_bw40fix, acphy_bw40pwr).
