 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/xmit.c       | 79 ++++++++++++++-------
 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/xmit.h       | 54 +++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 169 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

